<div class="chapter_content content" id="7684601_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="history">[HISTORY: Adopted by the Common Council of the City of Albany 7-18-1983 by L.L. No. 2-1983 as Ch. VII, Art. III, of the 1983 Code. Amendments noted where applicable.]</div><aside class="chapterrefblock"><h2 class="generalReferencesTitle">GENERAL REFERENCES</h2><div class="para">Commercial standards — See Ch. <a class="xref" guid="7681582" href="7681582#7681582">151</a>.</div><div class="para">Junk dealers — See Ch. <a class="xref" guid="7683399" href="7683399#7683399">239</a>.</div><div class="para">Transient retail businesses — See Ch. <a class="xref" guid="7685157" href="7685157#7685157">341</a>.</div><div class="para">Vendors — See Ch. <a class="xref" guid="7686038" href="7686038#7686038">363</a>.</div><div class="para">Zoning — See Ch. <a class="xref" guid="38067105" href="38067105#38067105">375</a>.</div></aside><div class="footnotes"></div></div>


